//
// TWO-PART CIRCULATION QUESTIONS had no exemplars at all, so they landed in a
// low-similarity no-man's-land where interlibrary_loan won by weight of
// numbers. Measured before this file:
//
//   "How long can I keep a book?"                       loan_policy  0.779  (margin 0.163)
//   "Can I renew my book?"                              renewal      0.799
